@host = http://localhost:5251

### Create enquiry
POST {{host}}/api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test Customer",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "designId": null,
  "quantity": 2,
  "enquiryType": "Normal",
  "requiredDate": null,
  "notes": "Interested in saree embroidery",
  "referenceImageUrl": null
}

### Get all enquiries
GET {{host}}/api/enquiries/admin